  "prompt": "What percentage of each country's units was sold on the web? Use the sales table and all its order lines. Return two columns, in this order: country_code and web_units_pct, 100 times the units on lines with channel 'web' divided by all units in that country, rounded to 1 decimal with ROUND(x, 1), so 15 percent is 15.0. A missing units value adds nothing to either total. Return one row per country_code. Any row order is fine.",
